  "runtime": {
    "108cfd20": "PolledLifetime at track+60 re-emits AudioEmitter category15/subtype0 every track update via1008ced0. TriggerType=Retrigger does not imply replaying the polled voice each frame.",
    "107eac80": "Finds existing same-patch instance at107eac96; creates only if absent. 107ead57 writes polled flag+21 and107ead63..6b refreshes timestamp+24. 107ead94..a9 skips retrigger for existing polled instances.",
    "107eada9": "Message maxDistance==0 skips both distance setters. Nonzero writes min and max. Thus mother inherits Patch10..55, fire overrides Patch3..35 with FIG2..25.",
    "107eadd6": "Message minPitch==1 skips its override, maxPitch==1 skips its override. Thus mother retains Patch.9..1.1; fire FIGmin1 leaves Patchmin.8 and max1.2 is set. Do not substitute FIG1..1.2.",
    "107eae1a": "VolumeFactor only applies below1, by multiplying current patch volume at107eae5a. Both loops use1 and preserve Patch gains1 and1.404762.",
    "10d754c0": "Registers fade_in_time and fade_in_ms through identical104a6400 property creator, and fade_out_time/fade_out_ms through104a6450. Fire fields500/1000 are milliseconds, hence .5s fade in/1s fade out.",
    "10928fb0": "AudioEmitter follows source world position and derives velocity from world delta/dt. No target-distance proxy is a source movement parameter."
  },
